[statement]
A package whose condition holds, and which forbids a package installed,
is passed over where it depends on the package completing its condition:
`b`, triggered by `d`, needs `d` and forbids `e`, both requested, and apk
installs `d` and `e` alone. Without the dependency on `d`, apk refuses
(`a-conflict-with-the-request-refuses-it`).

[repository]
P:b
V:1
D:d !e
i:d

P:d
V:1

P:e
V:1

[request]
d
e

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install d 1
install e 1
